{"availability":"available","full":"DailyDana/hoffmann-line-balancing","name":"hoffmann-line-balancing","description":"Assembly line balancing with Hoffmann's (1963) precedence-matrix method — Python core, CLI, Streamlit UI (EN/TR/DE/ES/FR). Live demo: hoffmann-line-balancing.streamlit.app","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-06T21:55:22Z","updated":"2026-09-06T23:06:28Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hoffmann-line-balancing.streamlit.app/","topics":["assembly-line-balancing","hoffmann","manufacturing","operations-research","python","salbp","streamlit"],"demo":"https://hoffmann-line-balancing.streamlit.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T00:01:47.206Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T00:01:47.206Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T00:01:47.206Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:30.231Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:32:32.485Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:26:34.258Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T00:01:47.206Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Assembly line balancing (SALBP-1) with Hoffmann's (1963) precedence-matrix method. Pure-Python core with no mandatory dependencies; command-line tool and a Streamlit interface available in English, Türkçe, Deutsch, Español, Français.","The first version of this project was a coursework assignment (MATLAB → Python port → Tkinter GUI; see archive/legacy/). A code review (archive/LEGACYREVIEW.md, in Turkish) showed that the implemented loop was not Hoffmann's method but a first-fit heuristic (\"take the first available task whose code is zero\"). Without subset enumeration it deviated from the optimum ([4,4,3,3,3,3], C=10 → 3 stations; Hoffmann finds 2). It also looped forever on precedence cycles, rejected fractional durations and silently dropped invalid input.","This repository was written from scratch; the old behavi